":36,\"documentId\":\"l3b47x55sxjqcs7pisuzjod3\",\"content\":\"【提防詐騙】近期手機預訂及網上購物活動增加，騙徒可能趁機利用釣魚短訊、偽冒銀行的來電、短訊、電郵、網站及虛假退款訊息進行詐騙。如有懷疑，請致電 +852 3898 6988 與我們聯絡，或瀏覽我們網站上「保安提示」。你亦可以瀏覽香港金融管理局網站上發布的提防詐騙資訊「智醒錦囊」。\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:07:15.971Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.787Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.814Z\",\"locale\":\"zh\"},{\"id\":37,\"documentId\":\"l3b47x55sxjqcs7pisuzjod3\",\"content\":\"【提防诈骗】近期手机预订及网购活动增加，诈骗分子可能趁机利用钓鱼短信、仿冒银行的来电、短信、电子邮件、网站及虚假退款信息进行诈骗。如有疑问，请致电 +852 3898 6988 与我们联系，或浏览我们的网站上「保安提示」。你也可以浏览香港金融管理局网站发布的防诈骗资讯「防骗锦囊」。\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:07:57.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:46.213Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:46.237Z\",\"locale\":\"zh-CN\"}]}],\"supportedLanguages\":\"$4:3:0:props:children:0:props:supportedLanguages\"}],\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"18:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"confirmConfig\":{\"id\":4,\"documentId\":\"b06ka5h3op6pmy6i5npmqtcc\",\"title\":\"你即將離開WeLab Bank網頁並進入第三方網頁。\",\"description\":\"\u003cp\u003e其第三方網頁可能受其他私隱及保安政策約束。我哋唔會承擔任何其第三方網頁提供的產品、服務及内容有關的責任。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e你確認繼續嗎？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"okBtn\":\"繼續\",\"cancelBtn\":\"取消\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-09T09:52:33.284Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-09T09:52:33.284Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-09T09:52:33.303Z\",\"locale\":\"zh\",\"localizations\":[{\"id\":2,\"documentId\":\"b06ka5h3op6pmy6i5npmqtcc\",\"title\":\"You are now leaving the WeLab Bank website and will enter a third party site.\",\"description\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe third party site may have different privacy and security policies than we do. We are not responsible for the products, services and content on such third party site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWould you like to continue?\u003c/p\u003e\",\"okBtn\":\"Continue\",\"cancelBtn\":\"Cancel\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-09T09:48:25.835Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-09T09:48:25.835Z\"