oncerns, please contact us at +852 3898 6988 or visit our “Security Tips” page. You can also learn some smart tips from the Hong Kong Monetary Authority website on how to prevent fraud.\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:08:19.120Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:48.734Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:48.757Z\",\"locale\":\"en\"},{\"id\":36,\"documentId\":\"l3b47x55sxjqcs7pisuzjod3\",\"content\":\"【提防詐騙】近期手機預訂及網上購物活動增加，騙徒可能趁機利用釣魚短訊、偽冒銀行的來電、短訊、電郵、網站及虛假退款訊息進行詐騙。如有懷疑，請致電 +852 3898 6988 與我們聯絡，或瀏覽我們網站上「保安提示」。你亦可以瀏覽香港金融管理局網站上發布的提防詐騙資訊「智醒錦囊」。\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:07:15.971Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.787Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.814Z\",\"locale\":\"zh\"}]}],\"supportedLanguages\":\"$4:3:0:props:children:0:props:supportedLanguages\"}],\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"en\",{\"className\":\"locale-404-container\",\"data-locale\":\"en\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"headerData\":{\"data\":{\"id\":25,\"documentId\":\"y5zxkds1p2auwv3ymnim7qi3\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-15T10:42:06.933Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-12T06:58:25.529Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-12T06:58:25.580Z\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"items\":[{\"__component\":\"menu.logo\",\"id\":26,\"url\":\"/\",\"logo\":{\"id\":914,\"documentId\":\"lyyc8niuaw1b19pzpcgng4ri\",\"name\":\"WeLab Bank_logo_en.png\",\"alternativeText\":null,\"caption\":null,\"width\":2580,\"height\":699,\"formats\":{\"large\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"url\":\"/uploads/large_We_Lab_Bank_logo_en_b54140e004.png\",\"hash\":\"large_We_Lab_Bank_logo_en_b54140e004\",\"mime\":\"image/png\",\"name\":\"large_WeLab Bank_logo_en.png\",\"path\":null,\"size\":95.85,\"width\":1000,\"height\":271,\"sizeInBytes\":95851},\"small\":{\"ext\":\".png\",\"url\":\"/uploads/small_We_Lab_Bank_logo_en_b54140e004.png\",\"hash\":\"small_We_Lab_Bank_logo_en_b54140e004\",\"mime\":\"image/png\",\"name\":\"small_WeL