ny concerns, please contact us at +852 3898 6988 or visit our “Security Tips” page. You can also learn some smart tips from the Hong Kong Monetary Authority website on how to prevent fraud.\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:08:19.120Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:48.734Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:48.757Z\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"localizations\":[{\"id\":36,\"documentId\":\"l3b47x55sxjqcs7pisuzjod3\",\"content\":\"【提防詐騙】近期手機預訂及網上購物活動增加，騙徒可能趁機利用釣魚短訊、偽冒銀行的來電、短訊、電郵、網站及虛假退款訊息進行詐騙。如有懷疑，請致電 +852 3898 6988 與我們聯絡，或瀏覽我們網站上「保安提示」。你亦可以瀏覽香港金融管理局網站上發布的提防詐騙資訊「智醒錦囊」。\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:07:15.971Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.787Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:43.814Z\",\"locale\":\"zh\"},{\"id\":37,\"documentId\":\"l3b47x55sxjqcs7pisuzjod3\",\"content\":\"【提防诈骗】近期手机预订及网购活动增加，诈骗分子可能趁机利用钓鱼短信、仿冒银行的来电、短信、电子邮件、网站及虚假退款信息进行诈骗。如有疑问，请致电 +852 3898 6988 与我们联系，或浏览我们的网站上「保安提示」。你也可以浏览香港金融管理局网站发布的防诈骗资讯「防骗锦囊」。\",\"state\":\"Valid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-14T02:07:57.076Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:46.213Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-15T08:32:46.237Z\",\"locale\":\"zh-CN\"}]}],\"supportedLanguages\":\"$4:3:0:props:children:0:props:supportedLanguages\"}],\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3b:I[6874,[\"874\",\"static/chunks/874-437a265a67d6cfee.js\",\"277\",\"static/chunks/277-6cd9c283f70fe2a1.js\",\"857\",\"static/chunks/857-7205a9904d50087f.js\",\"854\",\"static/chunks/854-cc4d4b719f8fbdc0.js\",\"496\",\"static/chunks/496-146188c8e23ae9de.js\",\"849\",\"static/chunks/849-e026f030ce84666c.js\",\"345\",\"static/chunks/app/not-found-aeb25bc10f0d808d.js\"],\"\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1f:[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/welab.bank/\",\"target\":\"_self\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"media\":{\"id\":28,\"documentId\"